; Freed by finishing his chase, not a starter: an Achievement unlock ("coursing" - in the Broken Circle, the
; Familiar taken as a hound runs down the Black Hares). Laelaps, the hound fated to catch whatever it
; hunted, set in stone on the heath mid-chase (tools/art/laelaps.py has who he is and how he is drawn).
; The one playable who is not a wizard, so he is outside the final chapter's gate (UnlockCatalog).
;
; He opens on Cyclone Slash - the whirlwind of a hound that never stops running, which builds while he
; moves and falls in when he stands - and on Wind, the one element no wizard opens on. He is the fastest
; on his feet and a little lighter than the wizards. His passive is the story's: he catches what is
; thrown at him (Player.TryCatchBolt).
